! Architecture Witness — v0.0 Transition

<<~ ahu #/what-v0-was>>

!! What v0.0 Was

The prototype froze at `@sdm/v0.0/**` (read-only archive). It proved that Powers could live as file-first `text/memetic-wikitext` memes in an Automerge/TW5 bag, and it ran an ''inheritance'' spine:

```text
api/powers/*          Powers API root: a default implementation
interfaces/power      a reusable contract
interfaces/powers/*   per-power contracts
  + an `implements`-family edge bound root -> interface
tags/{domain,function,hook,posture,storage}/*   addressed tag spirits
projections/powers/ftls-card/*    card surfaces
witness/powers/osr-spells/*       provenance
templates/{api,interfaces,projections,witness,tags}/*
```

It carried three proof Powers (read-magic, floating-disc, shield-ward), a `power-ontology` doc, and a `knowledge-oracle` module.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/why-it-retired>>

!! Why It Retired

The inheritance spine modeled a Power as a thing that //implements// contracts. Research (Ars Magica, ECS/Rust traits, Starfinder, Earthdawn) and the SDM corpus itself pointed the other way: a Power is a thing that ''has'' facets. The v0.1 model replaces inheritance with ''composition'':

| v0.0 (retired) | v0.1 (current) |
|---|---|
| `api/powers/*` root | `modules/powers/*` |
| `interfaces/` + `implements` edge | gone — flat `has` |
| `tags/{facet}/*` (alias spirits) | `components/{facet}/*` (addressed facets) |
| storage as a tag | `mount-points/{trait,item,structure,burden}` with contracts |
| `location` + `structure` storage classes | merged into one Site `structure` mount; mobility is a flat component |

The edge taxonomy collapsed to one flat verb (`#has`, no family/role) for composition, with the path prefix carrying semantics.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/migration-notes>>

!! Migration Notes

* v0.0 stays frozen. v0.1 holds ''no edges into v0.0'' — the archive is referenced only by name, here, in prose.
* Game text was rewritten fresh for v0.1, not pasted, so the new memes carry the composition shape natively.
* The `apocrypha` domain and the full ECM mode-set existed as v0.0 tags; v0.1 promotes a component meme only when a filter query demands the address (Principle 6).

<<~/ahu>>

